# Apex 3 only: MAMBAF722_2022A, Betaflight 2026.6.2.
# Match Betaflight's yaw mixer to the props-out motor rotation.
# Equivalent to Motors tab: "Motor direction is reversed" ON.
# This does not change ESC motor spin direction or motor order.
# Verify physical motor order and spin with props removed before flying.
set yaw_motors_reversed = ON
save
